<hr>
<h3 id=3D"TradeAllocationsMonitor-Testing,capacityplanning:"><strong>Testin=
g, capacity planning: </strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"960" data-layout=3D"wide" data-local-id=3D"f6d75=
380-8098-4438-a04f-30a305ad15f8" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><strong>Requirement</strong></p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p><strong>Jira reference</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create load tests to prove that KTable entries on kafka/concluent cloud =
does not have performance degradation on millions of groups.</p>
<p>Since KTable entries cannot be evicted on trade group complete, we will =
expire the entries by date ( start with 7 day retention), but using our cur=
rent max client base, the KTables should be able to still aggregate fast en=
ough after a week and having millions of groupIds in its key value pair dat=
a structures.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D"EBA-670=
" data-client-id=3D"SINGLE_6f5da7d4-1d35-3945-b105-6c7bba9fb34b_3075866628_=
62824a590dae78006806337b"> <a href=3D"https://purplegroup3.atlassian.net/br=
owse/EBA-670" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-wai=
t issue-placeholder"></span>EBA-670</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Getting i=
ssue details...</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lo=
zenge-default issue-placeholder">STATUS</span> </span></p>
<p></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create test controller methods to generate random groups of x messages a=
llocated to the same group and send to Trade Allocation monitor topic.</p>
<p>Takes number of trades as input, generates new UUID and number of trades=
 with correct values and status =3D 1. Returns the groupID</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D"EBA-656=
" data-client-id=3D"SINGLE_6f5da7d4-1d35-3945-b105-6c7bba9fb34b_3075866628_=
62824a590dae78006806337b"> <a href=3D"https://purplegroup3.atlassian.net/br=
owse/EBA-656" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-wai=
t issue-placeholder"></span>EBA-656</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Getting i=
ssue details...</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lo=
zenge-default issue-placeholder">STATUS</span> </span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Create test controller method to update percentage passed and failed by =
supplying a passPercentage as input.</p>
<p>Eg. If you will supply groupID and passRate =3D 70%. The method will que=
ry the database by groupId, update the statuses of the 70% to 2 or 4 depend=
ing on tradeTypeId and failed status =3D 3 of the rest in the group above t=
o mimic trades that fail or complete to test aggregator logic. It will then=
 resend the trades to the <strong>trade_allocation_status_update_monitor</s=
trong> topic Takes in GroupID as param and status.</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p><span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue" data-jira-key=3D"EBA-657=
" data-client-id=3D"SINGLE_6f5da7d4-1d35-3945-b105-6c7bba9fb34b_3075866628_=
62824a590dae78006806337b"> <a href=3D"https://purplegroup3.atlassian.net/br=
owse/EBA-657" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-wai=
t issue-placeholder"></span>EBA-657</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Getting i=
ssue details...</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lo=
zenge-default issue-placeholder">STATUS</span> </span></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p></p>
<p>Load test results:</p>
<p>Local load tests using transactional producing saw between 600-800 kafka=
 messages being sent per second.</p>
<p>Mongo db results for processing 10 000 trade allocations were: 10 second=
s to insert 1000, 45 seconds to query by trade allocation id, and 10 second=
s to update the status and save them again.</p>
<p>This was further improved by adding indexes to groupId and TradeAllocati=
onId in the respective Tradeallocation and TradeGroupstatus tables, which i=
ncreased performance to 10 000 records:</p>
<p>insert : 10 sec, query =3D 5 seconds, update =3D 4 seconds.</p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
